<title>GREECE: Greece to cut T-bill rates by 10 bps on Sept 2.</title>
<headline>Greece to cut T-bill rates by 10 bps on Sept 2.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece will cut its three-, six- and 12-month T-bill rates by 10 basis points to 11.90 percent, 12.10 percent and 12.70 percent respectively in its September 2 issue, the finance ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
